credit David D; Multiboard by Keep Making); this patch is a derivative
under the same terms — see scripts/patches/README.md. Drop it if upstream
adds a directional / wing-back snap parameter.

diff --git a/Modules/snapConnector.scad b/Modules/snapConnector.scad
